WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.910
I'm Pylon.

00:00:02.570 --> 00:00:04.469
I inspect claims at the harbour.

00:00:05.469 --> 00:00:08.897
A cone means nobody
has checked this one yet.

00:00:09.557 --> 00:00:12.251
I put one on every claim that washes in.

00:00:13.251 --> 00:00:15.513
There are more claims than cones.

00:00:16.173 --> 00:00:19.693
So I check what I can,
I show you where it came from,

00:00:19.693 --> 00:00:21.848
and I tell you what is still waiting.

00:00:22.848 --> 00:00:24.259
I won't guess for you.

00:00:24.919 --> 00:00:25.854
Your call.
